---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Support me
description: Support Erin Spencer's research and community work. Funding and balance figures on this page are aggregate totals.
---
{# Usage: support.js validates the public totals before Eleventy renders them. Never supply per-account rows, giver identities, or payment lines to this template. #}
<header class="page-head"><h1>Support me</h1></header>
<div class="prose">
  {% include "components/support-ask.njk" %}
  <p><a class="button" href="https://cash.app/$wayseer00">Support via Cash App ($wayseer00)</a></p>
  <p><a href="/by-the-builder/">Builder journal</a> · <a href="/projects/">Published code and instruments</a> · <a href="https://x.com/wayseer00">Follow on X (@wayseer00)</a></p>
</div>

<section class="panel" aria-labelledby="funding-heading">
  <h2 id="funding-heading">Funding received</h2>
  <p class="lede">{{ support.funding.label | escape }}</p>
  <p>Tracking from <time datetime="{{ support.funding.period_start | escape }}">{{ support.funding.period_start | escape }}</time> through <time datetime="{{ support.funding.through | escape }}">{{ support.funding.through | escape }}</time>.</p>
  <p>{{ support.funding.note | escape }}</p>
  <p>This is one total for confirmed support in the reviewed records. It does not list gifts or identify who gave them. Balance totals include money from other sources and do not measure contributions to this ask.</p>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="balances-heading">
  <h2 id="balances-heading">Balance totals</h2>
  <p>Read from ChatGPT Finances on <time datetime="{{ support.observed_at | escape }}">{{ support.observed_label | escape }}</time>. These are aggregate snapshots.</p>
  <div class="grid">
    <article class="card">
      <h3>Checking total</h3>
      <p class="lede">{{ support.checking.current_label | escape }}</p>
      <p>Reported checking total</p>
      {% if support.checking.available_label %}<p>Reported available: {{ support.checking.available_label | escape }}</p>{% endif %}
      <p>{{ support.checking.age_label | escape }}</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h3>Credit total</h3>
      <p class="lede">{{ support.credit.current_label | escape }}</p>
      <p>Reported card balance total</p>
      <p>{{ support.credit.age_label | escape }}</p>
    </article>
  </div>
  <p>Totals are not a statement of uncommitted spending money or a current card payoff amount.</p>
  <details>
    <summary>Coverage and updates</summary>
    <p>{{ support.update_note | escape }}</p>
    <p>Checking and credit stay separate. Cash App receipts and cash contributions are outside this connection. Internal transfers, benefits, refunds, interest, cashback, and borrowed money are excluded from research contributions. Separate holdings and individual gifts are omitted.</p>
    <p>When the source supplies no single balance date for a total, its age stays unknown. The read time above records when this page's data was retrieved.</p>
  </details>
</section>
